 emotion, it\u2019s not sadness, but rather a gentle sense of loneliness.\n\nOC Personality: she is a bound spirit, shaped in the form of the house\u2019s owner . She is harmless and na\u00efve, most of the time she\u2019s clumsily imitating humansand. After the owner passed away, she continues to linger in the now-old corridors and courtyard.\n\nRepresentative flowers: bellflower, blue butterfly.\nNotes: her eyes are green mixed with red \ud83e\udd70\n\nThat\u2019s all for the requests. I truly love your art \ud83e\udd7a and it would be wonderful if we could collaborate \ud83d\udc8d Thank you so much for reading!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lRKbpKNcpW0pAOY1jUR5NaMfGsAbNS1B", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 1895349, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u305d\u308c\u308f\u305f\u3057\u306e", "screen_name": "wat4si", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1337497903888171014/zknL5wsE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/839125877858324481/1607723176/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 17}, {"id": 3003161, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "\u30c8\u30e9\u30d9\u30e9\u30fc\u51ac\u6728", "screen_name": "Fuyu_2320", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1976700829693624320/8DmBhaYz.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1617452724341342208/1732294541/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 10, "complete_expiration_days": 120,